# avoids iOS Safari's Intelligent Tracking Prevention blocking the session cookie as "third-party"
# when the API is called cross-site via fetch (see the "same-origin deployment" fix for details).
# Must come before the SPA catch-all below.
/api/*    https://ghar-api.onrender.com/api/:splat    200

